OL,3,GNEWSAWho was the Titanic's only black
OL,4,Apassenger?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 10 April 1912 the most technically
OL,7,Fadvanced ship to ever set sail departed
OL,8,Fon its maiden voyage from Southampton.
OL,10,FThere were 2,201 people aboard RMS
OL,11,FTitanic bound for New York when, four
OL,12,Fdays later, it hit an iceberg in the
OL,13,FNorth Atlantic and sank.
OL,15,FThe tragedy has of course been told
OL,16,Fcountless times and in many formats -
OL,17,Ffrom contemporary newspaper reports to
OL,18,Fa huge Hollywood movie starring
OL,19,FLeonardo DiCaprio.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
