OL,3,GNEWSAWho was the Titanic's only black
OL,4,Apassenger?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the story of one of the estimated
OL,7,F1,500 people who perished remained
OL,8,Flargely forgotten until a sociologist
OL,9,Fhappened to visit a Liverpool museum.
